{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26594","headline":"送卢二弟茂才罢举游洛谒新相 · 姚合","name":"送卢二弟茂才罢举游洛谒新相","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"踏碎作赋笔，驱车出上京。\n离筵俯岐路，四坐半公卿。\n守命贫难掷，忧身梦数惊。\n今朝赴知己，休咏苦辛行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}